      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Annis hag of the Iron Present; daughter of Skabatha of Thither and one of the Three who rule Coven Cove. Eight feet of iron-shod appetite, always mending something: a net, a doll, a sail, a wound, a person. She runs the shipyards and is secretly feeding her own blood and thread to the dormant mimic-hulk in Drydock Seven, trying to birth a ship without the circle. While the coven circle is dead she has no Shared Spellcasting, no Hag Eye, and no shipbirth ritual; her <em>animate objects</em> is hers alone.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "source": {
        "custom": "Coven Cove GM Guide",
        "revision": 1,
        "rules": "2014"
      }
